@AutoShine_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Public: list active packages
GET {{AutoShine_HostAddress}}/api/packages
Accept: application/json

### Log in (use an account seeded from your Seed:* settings)
# @name login
POST {{AutoShine_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "your-demo-password"
}

### Available slots for a package on a date (yyyy-MM-dd, shop time zone)
GET {{AutoShine_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/available-slots?packageId=1&date=2026-10-05
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### My bookings
GET {{AutoShine_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
